      "desc": "Use it to obtain the Agent or unlock the Agent's Mindscapes.",
      "desc2": "\nSnapshots from Hugo's daily life and from in combat, recording important moments before and after he became an Agent.\nThese images also provide insights into his fighting style and favorite weapons, helping to better understand his strengths.\n\nIt seems there's also a note left inside, with slightly immature handwriting that reads:\n\"The godslayer is also a worshiper, and the fire thief eventually becomes kindling.\"\nUh, this is probably something Hugo wrote when he was younger... right?",
